UID:outlook-AKICd1PQAA@skylight-calendar-feed
DTSTAMP:20261009T090716Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261015T083000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261015T100000
SUMMARY:The Deloitte Academy: Retail & Consumer Board Update - The opportun
 ity for a Marketing Renaissance
CATEGORIES:Personal
DESCRIPTION:The consumer goods industry is on the cusp of a radical transfo
 rmation\, where ‘heart’ meets ‘head’ to unlock unprecedented growt
 h and reclaim marketing excellence. As organisations navigate a rapidly ev
 olving landscape\, they are being challenged to unleash creativity\, lever
 age emerging technologies\, and rethink talent\, agency\, and technology m
 odels. More than a marketing challenge\, this shift represents an enterpri
 se-wide opportunity to transform how businesses grow\, innovate\, and conn
 ect with consumers.\n\nIn this webinar\, we will explore how leading organ
 isations are:\n• Harnessing AI and emerging technologies to enhance mark
 eting effectiveness and accelerate growth\n• Balancing creativity and da
 ta-driven decision making to strengthen customer engagement\n• Rethinkin
 g talent\, agency and operating models to build future-ready marketing fun
 ctions\n• Embedding marketing transformation as a broader enterprise-wid
 e growth agenda\n\nWe hope you can join us on Thursday\, 15 October 2026 f
 rom 08.30 to 10.00.
END:VEVENT
